config FREETZ_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_TRADFRICOAP
	bool "tradfricoap 0.1.0"
	depends on FREETZ_PACKAGE_PYTHON3
	select FREETZ_PACKAGE_PYTHON3_APPDIRS
	default n
	help
		Access to IKEA TRADFRI gateways over CoAPs (DTLS): it is the library
		that the Domoticz IKEA Tradfri plugin uses.

		Both back ends of tradfricoap need a helper that speaks the CLI or the
		Python API of the project and both of them are written in **Go**
		(`coapcmd` and `py3coap`), so they are not provided by this tree: with
		this package alone tradfricoap cannot reach a gateway. The library is
		still installed for completeness and it would work as soon as a Go
		cross toolchain helper is available; the CoAP and CoAPs primitives
		themselves come from the `libcoap` package.
